      "as_of": "2026-06-26T06:44:19.967108+00:00",
      "insight": "Readers click ZKsync stories almost entirely on the 'who chose us' question — DeFi blue-chips, social apps, and banks picking ZKsync over rivals is the real story, while the ZK token itself barely sustained interest beyond launch day.",
